;; The cases the per-form differential check (bin/diffcheck; doc/FUTAMURA-SURVEY.md, "F2 as
;; built") leaves out of both runs, with the reasons: cases the back end and j2g cannot compile,
;; so that the rest of their corpus file is compiled (arbace.c2j compiles a source whole or not at
;; all, and j2g's errors stop the build). Each becomes (diffcheck.driver/excluded* ID FILE): a
;; later case that depends on it fails alike in both runs. Named FILE:LINE, as the oracle names
;; cases.
{:excluded
 [{:reason "j2g: Go names collide (J2G-SPEC §4.4, reported as an error): a reify inside an anonymous fn inside a fn (here the case's own fn) is named X$fn__N$fn$reify__M, so its declaring class X$fn__N$fn gets the Go variable X_fn__N_fn_class, the Go name of the static field fn-class of the code class X$fn__N (SA154). The runtime's namespaces have no such reify"
   :cases ["test/oracle/forms/concurrency.ae:106" "test/oracle/forms/concurrency.ae:223"
           "test/oracle/forms/concurrency.ae:244" "test/oracle/forms/concurrency.ae:364"]}

  {:reason "native.ae's copy in Clojure's pair (c2j:): Clojure in a fn or deftype handed over to the Java forms compiler names the namespace's vars (->Ext in Mutual's area, named in named's own body): j2g analyzes the Java forms compiler's classes without the namespace's vars (Unable to resolve symbol), as jforms-excluded.edn's dcf.defclass.Clj, and drops the class, so the compiled loader cannot make its constant (ClassNotFoundException) and the namespace does not load. A limit of j2g's (Clojure in Java forms classes outside the runtime, F2.4)"
   :cases ["c2j:test/oracle/forms/native.ae:157" "c2j:test/oracle/forms/native.ae:175"]}

  {:reason "native.ae's copy in Clojure's pair (c2j:): a deftype or defrecord inside a fn handed over to the Java forms compiler (in-fn, class-forms-in-methods, record-in-fn): the fn's class holds the deftype* as Clojure code, which j2g's analysis cannot compile (it would call the Java forms compiler, arbace.classes.native/compile-deftype, or names user.InFn), as jforms-excluded.edn's native.nested_deftype.Host; j2g drops the class. A limit of j2g's (F2.4)"
   :cases ["c2j:test/oracle/forms/native.ae:418" "c2j:test/oracle/forms/native.ae:421" "c2j:test/oracle/forms/native.ae:426"]}]}
